    "body": "For WebKit products:\r\n\r\n * https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/Source/WebCore/platform/ios/UserAgentIOS.mm\r\n * https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/Source/WebCore/platform/mac/UserAgentMac.mm\r\n * https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/Source/WebCore/platform/win/UserAgentWin.cpp\r\n * https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/Source/WebCore/platform/glib/UserAgentGLib.cpp\r\n * https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/Source/WebCore/platform/playstation/UserAgentPlayStation.cpp\r\n\r\nThis shows quite a lot of variety here, even before you get into application name suffixes.",
